This is a placeholder file. To use the attached profile photo in your portfolio:

1. Save the provided image attachment as `profile.jpg`.
2. Place the file at `assets/profile.jpg` (relative to the project root).

Once `assets/profile.jpg` exists, the portfolio will show that image in the About section.

If you'd like, I can add the actual image file for you — grant permission and I'll upload it as `assets/profile.jpg`.
